# COGNAPSE brand (required for UI work)

Read `brand/README.md` before changing interface code.

## Tokens (no drift)

- **UI accent:** `my-accent` — navy (light) / cyber yellow (dark). Buttons, tabs, nav.
- **Signal:** `my-signal` — orange `#F27D26`. Maps, pulses, premium bar, graph roots.
- **Surfaces:** `my-bg`, `my-sidebar`, `my-callout`, `my-border`, `my-ink`, `my-muted`, `my-syn`
- Never use `orange-500`, `amber-500`, `#F27D26`, or `rgba(249,115,22,…)` in components. Use `my-signal` / `shadow-signal`.

## Primitives

Prefer `src/components/ui`: `Panel`, `SectionLabel`, `MetaLabel`, `Button`, `PageHeader`, `StatusDot`.

Recipes: `src/styles/brand.ts` (`brandClasses`, `buttonVariants`).

## Layout & type

- Radius: `rounded-[2px]` or `rounded-[4px]` max on operational UI.
- Section labels: `text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-my-muted`
- Titles: `font-serif` italic for reports/heroes
- Copy: see `brand/COPY-VOICE.md` — no social/feed/board language

## Themes

Every new surface must work in **light and dark** using CSS variables in `src/index.css`.

## Final check

If it looks like generic SaaS or a social app, redo it.
